  "content_html": "<h1>Square Grid — Field Theory Symbolism</h1>\n<p>Five readings: flat grid, warped grid, uniform‑field grid, lattice‑gauge plaquette (Wilson loop), finite‑difference stencil.</p>\n<figure class=\"docsViewerFigure docsViewerFigure--image-right\"><img src=\"docs-media:collections/library/svg/d-20261028-114705-4d73dc/image-01.svg\" alt=\"Flat geometry\" title=\"Flat geometry\"><figcaption><span class=\"docsViewerFigure__caption\">Flat geometry</span></figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"docsViewerFigure docsViewerFigure--image-right\"><img src=\"docs-media:collections/library/svg/d-20261028-114705-4d73dc/image-02.svg\" alt=\"Curvature/warping\" title=\"Curvature/warping\"><figcaption><span class=\"docsViewerFigure__caption\">Curvature/warping</span></figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"docsViewerFigure docsViewerFigure--image-right\"><img src=\"docs-media:collections/library/svg/d-20261028-114705-4d73dc/image-03.svg\" alt=\"Uniform field\" title=\"Uniform field\"><figcaption><span class=\"docsViewerFigure__caption\">Uniform field</span></figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"docsViewerFigure docsViewerFigure--image-right\"><img src=\"docs-media:collections/library/svg/d-20261028-114705-4d73dc/image-04.svg\" alt=\"Lattice gauge plaquette\" title=\"Lattice gauge plaquette\"><figcaption><span class=\"docsViewerFigure__caption\">Lattice gauge plaquette</span></figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"docsViewerFigure docsViewerFigure--image-right\"><img src=\"docs-media:collections/library/svg/d-20261028-114705-4d73dc/image-05.svg\" alt=\"Finite‑difference stencil\" title=\"Finite‑difference stencil\"><figcaption><span class=\"docsViewerFigure__caption\">Finite‑difference stencil</span></figcaption></figure>\n<h2>References</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Minkowski space; Riemann curvature — <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Minkowski_space\">Minkowski space</a>; <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Riemann_curvature_tensor\">Riemann curvature tensor</a></li>\n<li>Uniform E‑field &amp; equipotentials — <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Electric_field\">Electric field</a>; <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Equipotential\">Equipotential</a></li>\n<li>Lattice gauge theory; Wilson loop — <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lattice_gauge_theory\">Lattice gauge theory</a>; <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wilson_loop\">Wilson loop</a>; <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevD.10.2445\">Wilson (1974), Phys. Rev. D 10, 2445</a></li>\n<li>Finite difference method — <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Finite_difference_method\">Finite difference method</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><small>2025-11-09</small></p>\n"
